's check each of the given matrices:\n\n- $A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}$  is *not* a rotation-scaling matrix since the entries on the main diagonal are not the same.\n\n- $B=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & -7 \\\\ -7 & -4\\end{bmatrix}$ is *not* a rotation-scaling matrix since the entries on the antidiagonal do not have opposite signs.\n\n- $C=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -3\\end{bmatrix}$ is *not* a rotation-scaling matrix since the entries on the main diagonal are not the same.\n\nIn conclusion, the correct answer is \"None.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326791 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087843 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "53b26ee4-53af-5660-a9e6-8e5cca8b3e1d" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Vertical Asymptotes With Common Factors in the Numerator and Denominator"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "91ec1a25-8adf-5207-b26a-3ae451be1d96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439731} {:answer/id #uuid "58b58a38-8e9a-51dd-bf57-949f83a6e8d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439732}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "91ec1a25-8adf-5207-b26a-3ae451be1d96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439731} :answer-field/id #uuid "6593a937-4442-598c-917f-48de74c14298" :answer-field/key "$x=-1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440223} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0163657b-bf49-5d60-9bde-e03ea6cd3d1e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439733} {:answer/id #uuid "3c11f501-5926-56a0-a30f-5768d5bb365b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439734}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3c11f501-5926-56a0-a30f-5768d5bb365b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439734} :answer-field/id #uuid "b416c2cb-ba76-5e43-910e-b07bc7418ba3" :answer-field/key "$x=0$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440224} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ebbc5dd0-f450-54ae-b05e-f18f4a0c2f9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439735} {:answer/id #uuid "f89504f5-87d6-54bb-9286-c7d6e1364a11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439736}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ebbc5dd0-f450-54ae-b05e-f18f4a0c2f9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439735} :answer-field/id #uuid "53af5bc4-d5bd-582b-8c98-b6c0fe211200" :answer-field/key "$x=1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186440225} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "77c2ceb7-5722-5be3-a2dd-50373bcf9f80" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668655} {:answer/id #uuid "28d31fc1-a22e-5cda-8863-f0f4941ab156" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668656}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "77c2ceb7-5722-5be3-a2dd-50373bcf9f80" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668655} :answer-field/id #uuid "770fd34f-76cf-541d-9719-60eef0858442" :answer-field/key "The function has no vertical asymptotes" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186668905}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486 :db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "720a20e0-eaeb-515c-b041-a17373ebe5f9" :question/math-academy-id "q-39931" :question/problem "Determine the vertical asymptotes of the function $f(x)=\\frac{{x}^{2}-4}{{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}}.$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "To find the vertical asymptotes of a rational function, we factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any common factors. Then, we set the denominator equal to zero and solve for $x.$\n\nFactoring the numerator and denominator and canceling any common factors, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & =\\frac{{x}^{2}-4}{{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(x-2)(x+2)}{{x}^{2}(x+2)} \\\\  & =\\frac{(x-2)\\cancel{(x+2)}}{{x}^{2}\\cancel{(x+2)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{x-2}{{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we set the denominator equal to zero:\n\n$$\n{x}^{2}=0\n$$\n\nThis gives the solution $x=0.$ Therefore, $x=0$ is the only vertical asymptote."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326792 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087845 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4b0b57da-f9af-5fab-a337-51ee4cb28f9e" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Vertical Asymptotes With Common Factors When the Denominator Has Complex Roots"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4f3c3348-eb0c-5468-aa98-ecdb90d6b160" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439737} {:answer/id #uuid "1521cff8-c574-52e1-bc38-0a4fe0cf4ca2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186439738}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4f3c3348-eb0c-5468-aa98-ecdb90d6b160" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #ed